    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong><br>In the city, titanium alloy coins will continuously appear. Collect as many coins as possible before your energy runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also talk to other robots to restore your energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the collected coins to upgrade the core attributes of the robot on the main interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use &quot;W, A, S, D&quot; to control the robot's movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the &quot;space&quot; key to jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold &quot;shift&quot; to sprint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press &quot;E&quot; to interact and talk.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong><br>In the city, titanium alloy coins will continuously appear. Collect as many coins as possible before your energy runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also talk to other robots to restore your energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the collected coins to upgrade the core attributes of the robot on the main interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use &quot;W, A, S, D&quot; to control the robot's movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the &quot;space&quot; key to jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold &quot;shift&quot; to sprint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press &quot;E&quot; to interact and talk.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a game that combines classic Pac-Man gameplay with a sci-fi third-person perspective. You will play as an energy-powered robot, embarking on an intense coin-plundering journey.",
